ames>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Lehmann</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Up-regulation of DNA methyltransferases DNMT1, 3A, and 3B in myelodysplastic syndrome</article-title><source>Leuk Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>325</fpage><lpage>329</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Leuk Res||29|325||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15661269</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Larson</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Le Beau</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Therapy-related myeloid leukaemia: a model for leukemogenesis in humans</article-title><source>Chem Biol Interact</source><year>2005</year><volume>153&#x02013;154</volume><fpage>187</fpage><lpage>195</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Chem Biol Interact||153&#x02013;154|187||bib13|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Melki</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Vincent</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Concurrent DNA hypermethylation of multiple genes in acute myeloid leukemia</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>3730</fpage><lpage>3740</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||59|3730||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10446989</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mizuno</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chijiwa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Okamura</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Akashi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surna